@1 = ~Thank you so much for saving me, stranger.~
@2 = ~Who are you? How did you get taken?~
@3 = ~Gratitude is sweet, but I prefer gold coins.~
@4 = ~It's okay. We cleared the way for you. Run to the nearest exit.~
@5 = ~My name is Shante and I work as a courtesan in Splurging Sturgeon, or rather the fine establishment beneath it. I was meant to meet a client of mine when suddenly I was grabbed and taken by these disgusting creatures. If you hadn't come, I dread to think what would've happened to me.~
@6 = ~You have the audacity to demand money from victim you just saved? Greedy bastards. You'll get nothing! Out of my way!~
@7 = ~Thank you. I wish I had something to give you, alas, all I have left are my clothes.~
